Description: Backport HP 3.26.6 security remediation onto Debian 3.26.4 packaging
Origin: backport, https://sourceforge.net/projects/hplip/files/hplip/3.26.6/hplip-3.26.6.tar.gz/download
Author: HP Development Company, L.P.
Bug-Debian: https://bugs.debian.org/1148269
Applied-Upstream: 3.26.6
Last-Update: 2026-11-17
 .
 HP 3.26.6 release SHA256:
 5fb2235a9cb6ec07cb4786c4066b151359c301324d54aaabf69ae7eef35606b3
 Carry its runtime and build-input changes, retaining Debian's existing patches.
 Printer models and distribution tables remain Debian's.
 Generated configure/Makefile.in are regenerated by Debian's autoreconf.
 Preserve Debian's quoted-shell pstotiff implementation and its HEAD argument.
 Keep check-plugin.py installation and exclude the proprietary ImageProcessor.
 The upstream security release removes the D-Bus plugin installation service;
 remove its Debian installation entries as well.
 .
 Backport integration: Daniel Campos Ramos, with AI assistance.

